WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.240
With the mobile application, you log into

2
00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:04.640
the account you previously created

3
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:07.680
on the pictotree.eu web app.

4
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.840
Once logged in, you can easily import

5
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:11.920
your binder constructions.

6
00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:13.719
This binder contains the different pages

7
00:00:13.759 --> 00:00:16.400
assembled earlier.

8
00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.440
To navigate through it, two different

9
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.760
interfaces are available.

10
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:23.840
The first one uses drop-down menus,

11
00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.640
while the second displays

12
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.760
the complete hierarchical tree

13
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.120
of the current page.

14
00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.880
To add a pictogram to the sentence strip,

15
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.320
simply select it

16
00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:38.440
and tap Add.

17
00:00:40.879 --> 00:00:42.600
At any time, you can reorder

18
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:45.839
the sentence strip, or even

19
00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.240
remove a pictogram by dragging

20
00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:51.840
it upwards.

21
00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:58.120
You can also add pictograms stored in

22
00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:00.159
your local device storage, photos you

23
00:01:00.199 --> 00:01:02.359
uploaded to pictotree.eu,

24
00:01:02.399 --> 00:01:04.600
or directly search and pick from the

25
00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:07.439
official ARASAAC pictogram bank.

26
00:01:07.479 --> 00:01:11.280


27
00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:14.840
With the sentence strip in full-screen mode,

28
00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:16.920


29
00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:19.280
you can enable the visual timer mode

30
00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:22.159
on each of the cards,

31
00:01:43.759 --> 00:01:47.439
and start the countdown timer.

32
00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:52.480
The application is offline-first.

33
00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:54.719
You have the option,

34
00:01:54.759 --> 00:01:58.560
by going into the app settings,

35
00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.520
to allow logging in without

36
00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:06.560
a password.

37
00:02:08.239 --> 00:02:10.680
Import and editing are then disabled,

38
00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:12.320
preventing accidental changes,

39
00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:13.480
and the app can be used safely

40
00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:17.920
without logging in.
